### Predict (upload image in your HTTP client)
POST http://localhost:8000/predict
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample_sneaker.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./samples/sample_sneaker.png
--boundary--
